- C's `(callback_fn, callback_ctx)` pairs (default callback, ALPN selectors, fuzzer, verify_sign, direct-receive) fold into single trait-object parameters; per-stream/per-path application contexts that round-trip unchanged stay as `*mut c_void`.
- Multi-output APIs (`picoquic_get_close_reasons`, `picoquic_cnx_get_padding_policy`, `picoquic_prepare_next_packet*`) return tuples or a `PreparedPacket` struct instead of taking out-pointers.
- `extern picoquic_congestion_control_algorithms` + its companion length variable collapse to one `picoquic_congestion_control_algorithms() -> &'static [...]` accessor.
- `va_list` has no Rust analogue; `picoquic_log_app_message_v` is dropped in favour of one entry point taking `core::fmt::Arguments<'_>`.
- `PICOQUIC_DATAGRAM_QUEUE_CAUTIOUS_LENGTH` is given the literal value of `PICOQUIC_ENFORCED_INITIAL_MTU` (1252) with a TODO; the symbolic constant lives in the not-yet-translated internal header.
- `core::net::SocketAddr` replaces `struct sockaddr*` everywhere.


